                  </content>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-13__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                    <num>4</num>
                    <content>
                      <p><role refersTo="#secretary">The Secretary</role> may, in writing, delegate <role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role>’s functions or powers under <ref href="#sec-10B">section 10B</ref> or 10C of this Act to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the Department.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-13__qstr-1__subsec-5">
                    <num>5</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>In performing a function, or exercising a power, under a delegation, the delegate must comply with any directions of <role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
